@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Ver Detalles

actor "Visitante" as Visitor
participant "SpaceDetailConsole" as Console
participant "GetSpaceUseCase" as UC
participant "SpaceRepository" as Repo

Visitor -> Console: Seleccionar espacio para ver detalles
activate Console
Console -> UC: execute(id)
activate UC
UC -> Repo: findById(id)
activate Repo
Repo --> UC: space
deactivate Repo
UC --> Console: space
deactivate UC
Console --> Visitor: Mostrar descripción, POIs y atributos del espacio
deactivate Console

@enduml
